                    <div class="hw-info">
                        <h3>Reserve The Property</h3>
                        <p>Once you’ve found your ideal property, simply click “Reserve” or contact our team to initiate the reservation process. We’ll guide you through the next steps and hold the property for you. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
